<LanguageData>
  <VCE_SantaAerodrone.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->A festive aerodrone has been detected in orbit, carrying a shipment of presents. You've acquired the means to redirect it, causing it to crash at [map_definite].\n\nWhen it crashes, the aerodrone will eject numerous presents into the air, scattering them across the area. Quickly collect them before they are lost or destroyed. [raidsDescription]\n\nThe aerodrone's remains will self-destruct in [destroyDelayTicks_duration], leaving nothing behind.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;一架节日无人机在轨道上被发现，载有一批礼物。 You've acquired the means to redirect it, causing it to crash at [map_definite].

When it crashes, the aerodrone will eject numerous presents into the air, scattering them across the area.在它们丢失或毁坏之前快速收集它们。 [raidsDescription]

无人机的残骸将在 [destroyDelayTicks_duration] 中自毁，不留任何痕迹。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->A jolly aerodrone laden with presents has been detected in orbit. With the right codes, you can redirect it to crash at [map_definite].\n\nUpon impact, the drone will scatter its precious cargo of presents across the area. Gather them quickly before they are claimed by others or destroyed. [raidsDescription]\n\nBe aware that the aerodrone’s wreckage will self-destruct in [destroyDelayTicks_duration].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;一架满载礼物的快乐无人机已在轨道上被发现。使用正确的代码，您可以将其重定向到 [map_definite] 处坠毁。

撞击后，无人机会将珍贵的礼物散布到整个区域。在它们被其他人占领或摧毁之前迅速收集它们。 [raidsDescription]

请注意，无人机的残骸将在 [destroyDelayTicks_duration] 中自毁。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->A festive delivery drone carrying a shipment of gifts has been located. You can use a special code to force it to crash at [map_definite].\n\nWhen it crashes, a burst of presents will rain down over the area, ripe for collection. Secure as many as you can before danger arrives. [raidsDescription]\n\nThe drone wreckage will obliterate itself in [destroyDelayTicks_duration].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;一架载有一批礼物的节日送货无人机已被发现。您可以使用特殊代码强制它在 [map_definite] 处崩溃。

当它崩溃时，大量礼物会如雨点般落到该区域，等待收集。在危险到来之前尽可能保护更多人。 [raidsDescription]

无人机残骸将在 [destroyDelayTicks_duration] 中自行消失。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->You've intercepted a signal from a holiday aerodrone packed with presents. Redirect it to crash at [map_definite] and claim the bounty of scattered gifts it will eject upon impact. [raidsDescription]\n\nHurry, as the drone’s remains will self-destruct in [destroyDelayTicks_duration], leaving nothing behind.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;您截获了一架装满礼物的假日无人机发出的信号。将其重定向到 [map_definite] 处坠毁，并领取碰撞时弹出的分散礼物的赏金。 [raidsDescription]

快点，因为无人机的残骸将在 [destroyDelayTicks_duration] 中自毁，不会留下任何痕迹。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription->An orbiting aerodrone brimming with festive presents has been detected. Using your codes, you can cause it to crash at [map_definite], releasing a cascade of gifts into the air. Collect them quickly and prepare for potential trouble. [raidsDescription]\n\nThe drone wreckage will destroy itself in [destroyDelayTicks_duration].-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;一架载满节日礼物的轨道飞行器已被发现。使用您的代码，您可以使其在 [map_definite] 处坠毁，向空中释放大量礼物。快速收集它们并为潜在的麻烦做好准备。 [raidsDescription]

无人机残骸将在 [destroyDelayTicks_duration] 中自我毁灭。</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)->\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] from [enemyFaction_name] will [droneDetectionMethod]. They’ll attempt to seize the presents, sending attackers approximately every [raidIntervalAvg_duration]. You’ll have a brief window to secure the area and defend your haul before they arrive.-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)-&gt;

[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] 来自 [enemyFaction_name] 将 [droneDetectionMethod]。他们会尝试夺取礼物，大约每隔 [raidIntervalAvg_duration] 就会派出攻击者。在他们到达之前，您将有一个短暂的时间来保护该地区并保卫您的货物。</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==false)->-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==false)-&gt;</li>
    <!--EN: droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==true)->spot the aerodrone during its descent-->
    <li>droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==true)-&gt;在无人机下降过程中发现它</li>
    <!--EN: droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==false)->detect the aerodrone's energy signature-->
    <li>droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==false)-&gt;检测无人机的能量特征</li>
    <!--EN: droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==true)->spot the festive aerodrone during its descent-->
    <li>droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==true)-&gt;在下降过程中发现节日无人机</li>
    <!--EN: droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==false)->detect the festive aerodrone's unique energy signature-->
    <li>droneDetectionMethod(enemyFactionNeolithic==false)-&gt;检测节日无人机的独特能量特征</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)->\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] from [enemyFaction_name] will [droneDetectionMethod]. They'll attempt to seize the presents, sending attackers approximately every [raidIntervalAvg_duration]. Use the time before their arrival to fortify your defenses and secure the gifts.-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)-&gt;

[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] 来自 [enemyFaction_name] 将 [droneDetectionMethod]。他们会尝试夺取礼物，大约每隔 [raidIntervalAvg_duration] 就会派出攻击者。利用他们到来之前的时间来加强你的防御并获得礼物。</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)->\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] from [enemyFaction_name] are sure to [droneDetectionMethod]. They’ll launch attacks roughly every [raidIntervalAvg_duration] in an attempt to claim the loot. Be ready to defend your spoils.-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)-&gt;

[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] 来自 [enemyFaction_name] 肯定会 [droneDetectionMethod]。他们大约每隔 [raidIntervalAvg_duration] 就会发起一次攻击，试图夺取战利品。准备好保卫你的战利品。</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)->\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] from [enemyFaction_name] will [droneDetectionMethod]. Convinced of the aerodrone’s value, they’ll attack approximately every [raidIntervalAvg_duration]. Prepare to protect the presents from their grasp.-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==true)-&gt;

[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] 来自 [enemyFaction_name] 将 [droneDetectionMethod]。由于确信无人机的价值，他们大约会每隔 [raidIntervalAvg_duration] 发起攻击。准备好保护礼物不被他们抓到。</li>
    <!--EN: raidsDescription(allowViolence==false)->-->
    <li>raidsDescription(allowViolence==false)-&gt;</li>
  </VCE_SantaAerodrone.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
